@startuml
title 2A - GitHub: comment / CI / push on a PR\nThe adapter reports facts; PrMaintainer decides whether the PR is ours

skinparam defaultTextAlignment left
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Human
participant GitHub
participant "GitHubAdapter" as GA
participant "Orchestrator" as O
participant "Store" as S
participant "SandboxPool" as P
participant "WorkerRunner\n(sandbox)" as R

Human -> GitHub: comment / push / check_suite
GitHub -> GA: webhook (signature verified)
GA -> O: facts{pr:repo#n, author, body, tags us, draft, merged}
note right of GA
  The adapter applies no policy: it marks which comments are
  ours so we never answer ourselves, and reports the rest.
end note

O -> S: instance for pr:repo#n?
return instance + state, or none

alt none, and nobody tagged us
  O -> O: nothing recorded, nothing opened
  note right of O: no instance, so nothing below happens
else none, and the comment tags us
  O -> S: record the ask
  return rr_resolved (subject came in the event)
  O -> S: create PrMaintainer instance
  return prm_pending
else we already follow it
  O -> S: record the ask
  return rr_resolved
end

alt a pass is already running
  O -> S: no change
  return prm_working
  note right of O: the running pass reads the whole conversation
else prm_pending or prm_waiting
  O -> S: state
  return prm_pending
  O -> P: enqueue SandboxRun(PrMaintainer)
  O -> S: state
  return prm_working
  P -> R: execute
  R -> GitHub: reply threads / rerun CI / push
  return replies, head_sha
  R -> P: result
  P -> O: run finished
  O -> S: close every ask the pass could read
  O -> S: state
  return prm_waiting
end
@enduml
